+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-deserialize-type-single-arg-generics-7e2b2466487134d9.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Fixed `deserialize_type` raising a `TypeError` when deserializing generics that accept a
+    single type argument, such as `typing.Optional`. This previously broke `Pipeline.loads`
+    for pipelines containing components (e.g. `BranchJoiner`) configured with an `Optional`
+    type.
